# The riposte as a pair before the engine logic pairs it: the fixture's bandit is stunned and held at the pair spot,
# 165 cm in front of the hero (where the engine will place it), the hero plays T_1HRIPOSTE, and at the blade's entry
# (400 ms, frame 10 of the riposte) the bandit is released and plays T_RIPOSTEVICTIM over the stun (`ani … force`).
# `still` keeps the riposte's own hit from stumbling the bandit first. Without the knockdown hand-over at the pull
# (840 ms) the victim's clip plays to its end and the bandit stands up again; the look of the pair is judged from
# the clips by the one who made them: side, behind the bandit, in front of the hero, then slowed 4x from the side.
# Content from scripts/content/anim/finish_set.py (reports/Свои ключевые позы ударов.md).
# `cam follow` angle 0 is in front of the hero, 180 behind.
# WORLD=NEWWORLD.ZEN TIMEOUT=900 OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=/abs/content
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
release all
overlay off
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
wait 500
watch player
clear 3000
corner right go 0
melee-shadow setup 1h
wait 600
melee-shadow target 2
wait 600
pin WOLF 5000 90 0
wait 34
pin off
pin WOLF 5000 -90 0
wait 34
pin off
immortal BDT_1013_BANDIT_L on
still BDT_1013_BANDIT_L on
animinfo T_1HRIPOSTE T_RIPOSTEVICTIM
wait 2000

cam follow 420 120 270
pin BDT_1013_BANDIT_L 165 0 0
stun BDT_1013_BANDIT_L posture
wait 600
rec pair-side
ani player T_1HRIPOSTE
wait 400
ani BDT_1013_BANDIT_L T_RIPOSTEVICTIM force
pin off
wait 1700
stop
wait 1500

cam follow 380 170 180
pin BDT_1013_BANDIT_L 165 0 0
stun BDT_1013_BANDIT_L posture
wait 600
rec pair-back
ani player T_1HRIPOSTE
wait 400
ani BDT_1013_BANDIT_L T_RIPOSTEVICTIM force
pin off
wait 1700
stop
wait 1500

cam follow 380 140 30
pin BDT_1013_BANDIT_L 165 0 0
stun BDT_1013_BANDIT_L posture
wait 600
rec pair-front
ani player T_1HRIPOSTE
wait 400
ani BDT_1013_BANDIT_L T_RIPOSTEVICTIM force
pin off
wait 1700
stop
wait 1500

slowmo 4
cam follow 420 120 270
pin BDT_1013_BANDIT_L 165 0 0
stun BDT_1013_BANDIT_L posture
wait 600
rec pair-slow
ani player T_1HRIPOSTE
wait 400
ani BDT_1013_BANDIT_L T_RIPOSTEVICTIM force
pin off
wait 1700
stop
wait 1500
slowmo 1
